<title>UK: BoE names SBC's Walker-Haworth to Takeover Panel.</title>
<headline>BoE names SBC's Walker-Haworth to Takeover Panel.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said on Wednesday it had appointed John Walker-Haworth as deputy chairman of the Takeover Panel with effect from July 17.</p>
<p>The central bank said Walker-Haworth, currently a managing director at SBC Warburg, succeeds John Goble.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
